From b28087b8f42c95a02f00f0dbf401f04281105fe5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: aeronexus <aeronexus@local>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 20:55:29 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] onprem: Farming Guide zone maps in the Mapping page

Zones button on index layers: create zone maps (classes, method, cell size,
min. area), list per layer, zones on the map, rates per zone with product and
unit, total amount, exports (Shapefile, ISO-XML, KML, GeoJSON) from the
farming service (VITE_FARMING_URL).
